{"sections":[{"slug":"tutorial-FOL","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"tutorial-FOL"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">教程</span> : <span lang=\"zh\">一阶语言与一阶逻辑</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">教程</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"教程 : 一阶语言与一阶逻辑"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"教程"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">数学语言是由什么构成的</span>?</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">观察如下一句话</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对任意自然数</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">与任意整数</span> $x,y,z$, <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $n \\geq 3$, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $x^n + y^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">不等于</span> $z^n$,</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">或写成符号形式</span>,</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\forall n,x,y,z\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\,(n\\geq 3)\\Rightarrow \\neg (x^n + y^n = z^n)$.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">这句话含有如下成分</span>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh\">变量</span></strong> $n,x,y,z$, <span lang=\"zh\">它们都有特定的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">类型</span></strong>, <span lang=\"zh\">记为</span> $n:\\mathbb{N}$, $x,y,z:\\mathbb{Z}$;</li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh\">常量</span></strong> $3 : \\mathbb{N}$;</li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh\">函数</span></strong> $x^n : (\\mathbb{Z}\\times\\mathbb{N})\\to\\mathbb{Z}$ (<span lang=\"zh\">幂</span>), $+ : (\\mathbb{Z}\\times\\mathbb{Z})\\to\\mathbb{Z}$ (<span lang=\"zh\">加法</span>);</li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh\">关系</span></strong> ${\\geq} : (\\mathbb{N}\\times\\mathbb{N})\\to\\mathsf{Prop}$;</li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh\">等式</span></strong> ${=} : (\\mathbb{Z}\\times\\mathbb{Z})\\to\\mathsf{Prop}$;</li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh\">逻辑运算</span></strong> ${\\neg} : \\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Prop}$ (<span lang=\"zh\">非</span>), ${\\Rightarrow} : \\mathsf{Prop}\\times\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Prop}$ (<span lang=\"zh\">蕴涵</span>);</li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh\">量词</span></strong> $\\forall : (A \\to \\mathsf{Prop}) \\to \\mathsf{Prop}$ (<span lang=\"zh\">全称量词</span>).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>… (todo, <span lang=\"zh\">或许不需要教程了</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">直接看</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/一阶语言","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">一阶语言</span>"}},{"Plain":")</p>\n"}]}}}]}